    "id": "Type.ppt.quotientDescent",
    "package": "TypeTheory",
    "kind": "property",
    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "en",
      "values": {
        "en": "Maps defined on a quotient",
        "zh-CN": "商上的映射"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "Let S : Setoid A and f : A → B. There is a unique map g : Quotient S → B satisfying g([x]ₛ) = f(x) for every x : A if and only if S.r x y implies f(x) = f(y) for every x,y : A.",
          "zh-CN": "设 S : Setoid A，f : A → B。存在唯一映射 g : Quotient S → B，使每个 x : A 均满足 g([x]ₛ)=f(x)，当且仅当对任意 x,y : A，S.r x y 蕴含 f(x)=f(y)。"
        }
      },
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(__list__[formula](@A,@B),Type),Type.annotation(@S,Setoid(A)),Type.annotation(@f,Type.to(A,B))),theorem(Iff(parentheses(ExistsUnique[binder](@g,Type.to(Quotient[native](A,S),B),Type.forall[forall](@x,A,Eq(B,Type.apply[paren](g,Quotient.mk(A,S,x)),Type.apply[paren](f,x))))),parentheses(Type.forall[forall](__list__[formula](@y,@z),A,Logic.implies(Type.apply[paren](Type.apply[paren](Setoid.r(A,S),y),z),Eq(B,Type.apply[paren](f,y),Type.apply[paren](f,z))))))))"
    },
